# How Git treats this repo's files, the same on every machine whatever its own Git settings.
#
# Text files are stored with LF line endings and checked out with CRLF. The tool is Windows-only
# and so is everyone who works on it, so CRLF on disk matches what Visual Studio writes and keeps
# diffs free of line-ending noise.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Never convert or diff these. The art PNGs and the icon are generated by art/make-art.cs and
# must stay byte for byte what it wrote.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
